From 176234f9f7f687e148099bd52b818c4f27765f8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adam Rutkowski <hq@mtod.org>
Date: Wed, 11 Feb 2026 12:24:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add 24h time range to dashboard and Stats API v2 (#6062)

* Implement '24h' in dashboard time range picker

* Implement "Last 24h" range for dashboard

* Implement comparison logic for 24h range

* Implement '24h' period for Stats API v2 queries

* Update ts types

* Make the option say 'Last 24 Hours' and move within range picker

* Update CHANGELOG

* Remove unnecessary date shifting, 'to' is always 'now'

* Update CHANGELOG

* Remove another unnecessary shift

* Use :"24h" input_range in consolidated views on /sites
